  "aiOverview": {
    "content": "Nikki and Brie Bella left WWE in March 2023 to regain control of their brand and focus on new ventures, rebranding themselves as the Garcia Twins. They departed after 16 years to move away from the \"Bella Twins\" persona, focusing on entrepreneurship, family, and hosting, and have since returned for special appearances, including in 2026. Current Status and Life After WWE Name Change: They now operate under their legal names, Nikki and Brie Garcia. Business Ventures: They run their own businesses, including their wine brand, Bonita Bonita, and continue to host The Nikki & Brie Show (formerly The Bellas Podcast). Media Projects: They appeared in TV projects such as Twin Love. WWE Departure: They left because they felt it was time to close the \"Bella Twins\" chapter, feeling it was no longer \"energetically aligned,\" but noted the departure was bittersweet. WWE History: Inducted into the WWE Hall of Fame in 2021, they are recognized for their legacy, with Nikki holding the record for the longest-reigning Divas Champion at 301 days. Recent Activity: They celebrated their 40th birthday in November 2023 and made a return appearance at the Royal Rumble in early 2026. This video shows the Bella Twins talking about their decision to leave WWE and embrace their new chapter:1mThe Kelly Clarkson ShowYouTube• Dec 13, 2023 1m",
